8,0:01:32.62,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:26.19,0:01:32.63,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.20,0:01:32.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:26.21,0:01:32.65,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.22,0:01:32.66,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:01:26.23,0:01:32.67,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.24,0:01:32.68,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.25,0:01:32.69,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.26,0:01:32.70,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.27,0:01:32.71,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.28,0:01:32.72,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.29,0:01:32.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.30,0:01:32.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.31,0:01:32.75,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:26.32,0:01:32.76,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.33,0:01:32.77,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:32.78,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:01:26.35,0:01:32.79,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 1,0:01:26.36,0:01:32.80,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.37,0:01:32.81,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.38,0:01:32.82,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 1,0:01:26.39,0:01:32.83,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.84,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:01:26.41,0:01:32.85,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:36.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege.Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:37.44,Title,,0,0,250,,Emperor Assassination PlanDialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:41.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in assassinating Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But is she really the type of person we can kill with guns and cannons?Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,From what I've heard, she's like an iron balloon.Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like this is going to be impossible.Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:02:01.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if we're going to do this assassination, it has to be done in one blow.Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:04.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'll be caught in a siege and get killed.Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Is an Emperor really as strong as they say?Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Definitely! She's a monster!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:16.58,Main,,0,0,0,,When we tried to retrieve Brook, she was fast asleep. But I still thought we were goners!Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:23.03,Main,,0,0,0,,She killed her own son for the sake of sweets.Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,On that note, why did you choose the Tea Party, where all of her top officers will be in attendance?Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:31.28,Main,,0,0,0,,as the assassination location, Bege-san?Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:36.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I knew you guys would ask that...Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:40.07,Main,,0,0,0,,First of all, let me explain something.Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:45.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Under exact conditions, we'll only need five seconds to kill Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:48.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Only five seconds?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:50.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not only five seconds-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:55.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It's won't be that easy to  create that five second opening at the party-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The Big Mom Pirates is made up of a bunch of skilled fighters, and they'll all be there.Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Within a split second, monsters like the Sweet Commanders will attempt to stop us-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:11.47,Main,,0,0,0,,At that point, it'll be a head-on fight, and we have no chance of winning that!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:20.05,Main,,0,0,0,,This assassination plot began with the capture of Caesar.Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:24.85,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Gastino! Don't ever  call me that in front of Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:30.99,Main,,0,0,0,,When this mission is over, you'll give me back my heart and free me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:32.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what we agreed to!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:34.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that.Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,If you break your promise, I'll personally murder your son.Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:47.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get paranoid now, Gas-hiko! Bege will keep his word!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Gas-hiko?! No, it's Gastino!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Gas-hiko!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You little...!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares what your name is? You're still a scumbag.Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:03.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyways, he's got a very crucial job.Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:05.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me show you what I made!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Deadly poison gas - KX Launchers!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:16.90,Main,,0,0,0,,One will do the job, but I've got two extra, just in case!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:21.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Each of them can inject five grams of deadly organophosphate gas...Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,d-directly into your body!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:30.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the most audaciously sinful murder weapon in history!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:36.36,Main,,0,0,0,,The gas will destroy the average person by just touching their skin.Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:41.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So if it's injected directly into your body...Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm 100 percent sure...Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:47.89,Main,,0,0,0,,No, 200 percent sure that you'll...Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,die!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You're definitely gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.07,0:04:56.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone will die!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get the picture.Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,So you have a weapon that will kill her if it hits her?Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,No, unfortunately...Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:09.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If Big Mom is at full strength...Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:13.16,Main,,0,0,0,,This weapon won't be able to pierce through her skin.Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,There aren't that many weapons that'll work against Big Mom in this world!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:28.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Then it's pointless to have that thing!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta look at the big picture.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:34.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I said it wouldn't work when she's at full strength.Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There are two conditions necessary to ensure the KX Launcher does the job properly!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,First we need a five-second window where no one is able to attack us.Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:49.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Secondly, Mama's body has to be weakened somehow.Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:52.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of convenient situation is that?Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:06:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,There is one place where  all those conditions will be met...Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the tea party!Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pez!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:19.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Your daddy-waddy was too loud!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:20.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay, it's okay!Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:26.15,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been allied with Mummzie-wumzies for about a year now...Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:28.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, but we've never seen her get hurt.Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Even when she destroyed the city...Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:37.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Even when bullets...Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,or bombshells hit her...Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:49.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Even when she sinks a ship...Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:57.31,Main,,0,0,0,,We never saw her get a single scratch on her body.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,As you said, she's just like an iron balloon.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.69,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:13.03,Main,,0,0,0,,...there was one time  I saw Mummzie-wumzie get a scratch.Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:17.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The Mother Carmel Picture Incident-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:27.80,Main,,0,0,0,,At tea parties, there's always a picture placed directly in front of Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:31.01,Main,,0,0,0,,and nobody else sits there.Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:35.44,Main,,0,0,0,,It's one of her most prized treasures.Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:37.93,Main,,0,0,0,,A picture?Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:42.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a portrait of Mother Carmel!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:45.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You could say that it's Mama's only weak point!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that person?Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems like Mama is indebted to her, but we don't know the details.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a figure of mystery.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:58.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Is she dead?Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard she disappeared.Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.87,Main,,0,0,0,,So she is a missing person.Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:08.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Even those in the family don't know the specifics.Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:16.40,Main,,0,0,0,,One time at a tea party, one of the servants accidentally knocked it off of the table.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mother...Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I was stunned by Mama's reaction to it.Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,She turned pale, and let out  a loud shriek that I'd never heard before!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It was different from her hunger pangs!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:52.72,Main,,0,0,0,,All we could do was just  cover our ears to protect our eardrums...Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:57.35,Main,,0,0,0,,People were passing out and collapsing one after another!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of the shriek,  she unleashed her Conquerors Haki!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,All because of a jostled picture.Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:11.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The point is what happened next.Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:22.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama knelt down from shock and, believe it or not,Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:26.65,Main,,0,0,0,,she scraped her knee and it was bleeding!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:32.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I was surprised because I didn't think she had red blood flowing through her veins.Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:38.97,Main,,0,0,0,,When she breaks down like that, her body becomes fragile.Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:46.89,Main,,0,0,0,,So, at the tea party today, if we break  that picture in half, what do you think will happen?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:53.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama will be devastated!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:58.82,Main,,0,0,0,,And no one there will be able to move for more than five seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:02.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Then the KX Launcher  will show its real strength...Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,and the Emperor, Big Mom, will be killed!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The news of the assassination of Big Mom will spread across the world!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,But isn't that shriek gonna paralyze us, too?Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:25.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We have these.Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,"Invisible Symphonia System"!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:30.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, earplugs!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If breaking that picture creates such a big mess...Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Then we gotta save Sanji's family during that time, too.Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't act like it'll be that easy.Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll take three seconds for Mama to freak out, after the picture is broken.Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're surrounded by the  angry Big Mom Pirates before it gets messy,Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:55.84,Main,,0,0,0,,it'll be miraculous for you to stay alive for three seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:11:00.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I need you to take that role, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! That means Luffy is going to be bait!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege! Nami and her friends saved Lola!Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you ask him to be a sacrifice?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:11.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:14.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:27.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You need to think twice about this...Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:33.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I just came up with an awesome way to arrive at the party.Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,A way to show up?Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:42.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What is it? Sounds like fun! I wanna hear it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:43.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,No way. If I tell you now, it'll ruin the fun.Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,– What was I worried for? – What was I worried for?Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:52.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. Then, I'll be counting on you.Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.85,0:11:54.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, do you know when to break the picture?Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,When Sanji kisses Pudding, right?Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot, I won't do that! I can't!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,The wedding kiss will draw everyone's attention away.Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That's precisely when...Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-san will shoot Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll dodge her shot.Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.70,0:12:21.76,Main,,0,0,0,,The gunshot will be the cue.Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Sounds easy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:27.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go over the plan.Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:34.69,Main,,0,0,0,,When Pudding shoots, Straw Hat will break the picture!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom will start to shriek.Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:43.78,Main,,0,0,0,,And we'll put the Invisible Symphonia System in our ears.Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Say "earplugs".Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, it'll be downhill from there.Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,While the party-goers are in a panic, you guys will rescue Germa.Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,And with the KX Launcher and the deadly poison gas shell,Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.70,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll assassinate Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:04.51,Main,,0,0,0,,This all needs to be finished in 10 seconds.Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as we kill Big Mom,Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,this idiot will arrive.Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's when I'll arrive!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:13.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling an idiot?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,– He's such a piece of crap. – Is this jerk part of the plan?Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:24.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, since I can fly, I'll plunge on to the site with a mirror to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:27.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Along with this woman!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:31.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not part of this! Mama's gonna kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:35.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys did a great job bringing Brûlée here.Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have hoped for a more useful power to help us escape.Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Your compliment doesn't make me happy, you fool!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you finish, dive into Caesar's mirror quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:54.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom will still be shrieking.Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:58.85,Main,,0,0,0,,And then, we can just run away in the mirror dimension at our own pace.Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:05.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The mirror will provide you  the quickest way to escape from the island.Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:09.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Through the Mirro-world, we can get to the Sunny in no time.Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's quite a plan.Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:13.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it's gonna work well!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,These bastards...!Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Once each of us gets to  our own ships, our alliance is over.Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We should just get out of this territory as fast as we can.Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck in battle!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:29.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess we're set.Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:36.03,Main,,0,0,0,,The party starts at 10:00, right?Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:40.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Two and a half hours to go...Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:44.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta go back to my room, since I'm the groom.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:49.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to go back, too. Let's get ready for fake security duty.Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.82,0:14:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bege. Could you do me a favor?Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:55.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,When I show up in a funny way...Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:15:00.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't try to be funny! You're gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:05.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,Cheese Town, Milk IslandDialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:05.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Today is a holiday because of the Tea Party!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate with Supreme cheese and beer!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,So Pudding-sama's old enough to get married now.Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:16.72,Main,,0,0,0,,The groom is Germa 66's third son. We'll have a strong ally!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:21.60,Captions,,0,0,0,,Peanuts Town, Nuts IslandDialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard the whole Du Feld Conglomerate has arrived.Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:23.86,Main,,0,0,0,,A lot of prestigious guests are going to be there today.Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:28.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You're celebrating too early!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:31.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Chocolat Town, Cacao IslandDialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:31.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay! I'm so happy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:35.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Today's Sanji-sama's wedding.Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:39.12,Main,,0,0,0,,The escort soldiers weren't allowed to enter the castle.Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:39.12,Captions,,1000,0,350,,Germa KingdomDialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:41.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Obviously, we can't attend either.Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:45.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course not. No one needs a guard for a wedding.Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it should be a peaceful day.Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:51.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:56.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone from the Vinsmoke Family, good morning!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Yonji!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Wake up and change!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:03.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,6th Floor - A Guest Room In the Baum CakeDialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:03.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Reiju? She's not in her room.Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I haven't seen her since yesterday.Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Reiju-sama finished with  her preparations in another room.Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,There is still an hour before  the Tea Party, so take your time.Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:23.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:27.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,9th Floor - Big Mom's BedroomDialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:27.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Call the Ministers!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:35.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's not moving! It's dead!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:38.85,Main,,0,0,0,,My cute little skeleton!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too bad, but Mama...!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Today is the Tea Party that you've been waiting for.Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:52.07,Main,,0,0,0,,And what else?Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:59.51,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ The wedding cake! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Mr. Morgans and all the other VIPs have already arrived.Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:18.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,Eastern Inlet, Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:26.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't do this to me! Untie me, Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:32.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,Aladine, The First Mate of the Sun PiratesDialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:29.61,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll leave some water and food.Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:32.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry but I'm sure someone'll find you soon.Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:34.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys going?! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,– We're leaving this country. – What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why you guys were carrying out your stuff all night long...Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:46.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are affiliates of the Big Mom Pirates and you're leaving the country...Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That means you're betraying Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:59.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Does she know about this?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't let her find out.Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:04.35,Main,,0,0,0,,She'll kill those who leave.Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:06.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what she does, right?Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:11.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe told us to say thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:13.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe did?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:20.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We're very lucky to have heard Pekoms' story.Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:26.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think Bege can pull off his plan to kill Big Mom that easily,Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:30.69,Main,,0,0,0,,but I can't believe Mama is plotting to assassinate Germa, too.Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:36.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If Luffy and his crew find out about it, they'll push themselves to save Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:42.18,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll be in danger, and I can't just sit back and watch! I've got to help them!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:46.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That means I will raise...Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:49.35,Main,,0,0,0,,a full-fledged rebellion!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.81,Captions,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Praline 21st Daughter of the Charlotte Family, Aladine's WifeDialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:53.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I will betray Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:58.78,Main,,0,0,0,,To fufill my duty to her, I tried to tell her that I was leaving.Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.45,Main,,0,0,0,,But I withdrew that request,Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,because of the numbers I saw on the roulette wheel.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Those numbers represented the comrades who would've been victimized along with me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I need you all to escape from here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The price that Big Mom wanted me to pay...Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,was an unreasonable sanction that was more than taking my life!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,On the day of the Tea Party, the Hors d'oeuvre Ships,Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:33.44,Main,,0,0,0,,interceptors from each island,  will escort the guests, and security will be relaxed.Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.44,0:19:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,And if something happens at the Tea Party, it'll draw everyone's attention.Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.63,0:19:40.74,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's your chance to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:44.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared for that. That won't be a problem. But Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:50.62,Main,,0,0,0,,All we want to do is ensure that you can be free.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:53.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.48,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you don't!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to save Straw Hat, you'd sacrifice your own life!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:04.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's say I join the Straw Hats one day...Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:13.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I will be fighting for my captain, Straw Hat Luffy,  with my own life on the line!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Aladine, it's just a matter of...Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.06,0:20:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,doing it now or later.Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.55,0:20:24.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Do as you like.Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But do your best to save your own life too.Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay?Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll set sail for Fishman Island.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You're worried about the Ryugu Kingdom too, right?Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:42.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:45.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll protect it no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize! We've known each other for decades.Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:57.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll live to see each other again, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:09.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would Jinbe feel the need to thank me?Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, did he tell Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get ready to leave!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:15.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:23.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Where were you, Reiju?Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:22.75,Captions,,0,970,360,,Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you guys were partying the whole night. So that's why I asked for a quieter room.Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:32.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Give a grown woman her privacy, you idiot.Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:39.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go. The Tea Party will take place on the roof.Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:47.32,Main,,0,0,0,,At last, Germa 66 will have Big Mom's power on our side,Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,and will rule the North Blue again!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.49,0:21:52.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You're in a good mood.Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,But most importantly... Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.91,0:21:58.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji hasn't run away, has he?Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:01.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Both the groom and the bride are fully prepared.Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:06.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Sanji? Why didn't you escape?Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:09.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You know what's going to happen.Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.41,0:22:14.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm depressed.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:16.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:17.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you nervous?Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:20.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:22.16,Captions,,950,0,390,,Pudding's RoomDialogue: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get any blood on me, after I kill that dumb Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.51,0:22:33.49,Main,,0,0,0,,And in order for everyone to continue to see me as a good girl, I'll have to erase everybody's memories.Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.34,0:22:37.52,Main,,0,0,0,,When I think about all that...Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It sounds like a pain in the ass!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.95,0:22:49.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own objectives...Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.87,0:22:54.44,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and the Tea Party from hell will start soon!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.37,0:23:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ It's gonna start! ♪ – ♪ It's gonna start! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.75,0:23:26.13,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ It's time for Mama's Tea Party! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.13,0:23:32.34,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ It's time! ♪ – ♪ It's time! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.69,0:23:38.31,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ A Porkswagon comes rushing ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.31,0:23:40.56,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ I wonder if he can make it. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:44.77,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ He's late! ♪ – ♪ He has to hurry! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.77,0:23:50.07,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ The big guests... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.07,0:23:54.07,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ will come out! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.21,0:24:07.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,Loan Shark KingDialogue: 0,0:24:07.88,0:24:10.22,Captions,,0,0,0,,"God of Fortune" Du FeldDialogue: 0,0:24:16.43,0:24:21.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,Queen of the Pleasure DistrictDialogue: 0,0:24:28.65,0:24:32.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,Major UndertakerDialogue: 0,0:24:41.50,0:24:45.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,President of The World Economic JournalDialogue: 0,0:24:46.50,0:24:48.84,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Big News" MorgansDialogue: 0,0:24:52.47,0:24:57.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,Warehouse KingpinDialogue: 0,0:24:58.31,0:25:01.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,Giberson "The Concealer"Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:09.65,Captions,,0,0,0,,Shipping KingDialogue: 0,0:25:10.36,0:25:13.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Deep-Sea Currents" UmitDialogue: 0,0:25:20.32,0:25:25.11,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Why did you get invited-nen, undertaker? ♪Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.11,0:25:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ You're so small-minded, Stop it ♪Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.50,0:25:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Stussy-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.57,0:25:32.09,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Can't an undertaker celebrate people's weddings? ♪Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:39.35,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ I won't have anyone who smells so much like blood  talking shit about me, Du Feld! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.35,0:25:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Hey, I'm so happy to be invited ♪Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.02,0:25:47.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Morgans-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.31,0:25:52.46,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ This marriage will be big news! Germa and our company are strongly tied ♪Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.07,0:25:58.12,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ But it's a story that has already been spread across the underworld ♪Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.12,0:26:00.57,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ So it's too old! ♪ – ♪ That's right, that's right ♪Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.57,0:26:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ It doesn't need to be transported ♪Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.77,0:26:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Hi there, how are you? Welcome! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.96,0:26:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Perospero-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.54,0:26:14.92,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Leaders of the underworld ♪Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.92,0:26:18.01,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ If you walk through the castle you're going to be a little late! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.01,0:26:20.01,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Would you like me to... Perorin... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.01,0:26:23.39,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ take you there? ♪Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.86,0:26:30.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ By the Candy Escalator! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:07.23,Main,,0,0,0,,– This is amazing! – His candy sculptures are always...!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.23,0:27:12.15,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ a true work of art! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.27,0:27:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm humbled.Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.34,0:27:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama hates late arrivals.Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.26,0:27:22.16,Main,,0,0,0,,So, shall we?Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.16,0:27:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the staircase is moving!Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.62,0:27:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.57,0:27:31.53,Main,,0,0,0,,This is great. Very easy.Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.53,0:27:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,See you later.Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.15,0:27:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You can have these.Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.60,0:27:42.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for three minutes and you can lick the Candy Escalator, too.Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.56,0:27:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I've gotta go, too.Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.03,0:28:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It smells good.Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.75,0:28:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Please come in.Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.46,0:28:13.54,Main,,0,0,0,,This place always looks so delicious-nen.Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome, guests.Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.73,0:28:18.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Hi, Smoothie.Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.19,0:28:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Would you like a welcoming drink?Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.63,0:28:26.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Today, we have a little bit of Mt. Mauri Lava, a beautiful woman who stabbed a thousand men,Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.69,0:28:30.35,Main,,0,0,0,,and a giraffe that makes funny sounds.Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.35,0:28:33.16,Main,,0,0,0,,– l'll have a cup of the giraffe. – Me too.Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.16,0:28:35.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll squeeze it now.Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.51,0:28:43.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious!Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.45,0:28:48.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Here you go.Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.20,0:28:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,It tastes so good. And it's smooth to drink, too.Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.25,0:29:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Open up!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be searched!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:05.87,Captions,,1040,0,320,,Outside the Tea PartyDialogue: 0,0:29:03.62,0:29:06.41,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you can't do that, Mr. Jigra.Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.41,0:29:08.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.03,0:29:11.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I said let go of me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.18,0:29:16.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,Organ Dealer JigraDialogue: 0,0:29:17.12,0:29:20.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Big Mom already inside?Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.61,0:29:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,See, I had an invitation from the last tea party.Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.32,0:29:30.58,Main,,0,0,0,,But sadly, I was unable to attend.Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.58,0:29:34.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I had to attend my mother's funeral!Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I wrote my reasons in a letter,Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.92,0:29:41.30,Main,,0,0,0,,but guess what Big Mom sent me in response?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.17,0:29:48.01,Main,,0,0,0,,It was my hospitalized father's...Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.16,0:30:10.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who shot?! He's a guest!Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.15,0:30:16.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You are...Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.00,0:30:27.10,Captions,,500,0,660,,One of the Three Sweet CommandersDialogue: 0,0:30:24.01,0:30:28.00,Captions,,0,50,130,,Big Mom PiratesDialogue: 0,0:30:26.01,0:30:28.01,Captions,,0,300,465,,Second Son of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:30:28.01,0:30:31.00,Captions,,0,300,465,,Second Son of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:30:28.01,0:30:32.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,Bounty: 1,057,000,000 BellyDialogue: 0,0:30:34.40,0:30:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Sweet Commander Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.40,0:30:41.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you shoot him?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.77,0:30:44.53,Main,,0,0,0,,This is what he was going to say:Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.13,0:30:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,"Guess what Big Mom sent me in response?!"Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.49,0:30:53.99,Main,,0,0,0,,"It was my hospitalized father's head."Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.99,0:30:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,"I'm here today to get revenge."Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.58,0:31:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,,"Open the gate."Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.71,0:31:01.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Bang.Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.54,0:31:04.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Bang, he shot.Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.75,0:31:09.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Two of your men would've been shot.Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.14,0:31:17.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong for me to throw a  jelly bean at him before that happens?Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.76,0:31:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Rook Bege.Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.93,0:31:25.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell Mama that I made the decision.Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.16,0:31:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,This is what you're gonna say now:Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.75,0:31:32.27,Main,,0,0,0,,"I see."Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.27,0:31:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,"Alright then."Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.82,0:31:40.57,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He'll be the biggest pain in the ass at the party.Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.57,0:31:46.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,His Observation Haki is so good, that he's able to see slightly ahead into the future.Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.19,0:31:48.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,His bounty is over a billion.Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.26,0:31:50.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.06,0:31:54.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Alright then.Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.68,0:31:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,It's about time.Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.91,0:32:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's time for the Tea Party.Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.80,0:32:37.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Thank you for coming all this way!Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.11,0:32:53.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Wherever you look, all you see is sweets!Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.79,0:33:02.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat!Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.71,0:33:05.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Drink!Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.54,0:33:13.43,Main,,0,0,0,,And enjoy the party to your heart's content!Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.34,0:33:17.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Enjoy everything...Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.18,0:33:20.58,Main,,0,0,0,,that'll take place here!Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.17,0:33:28.20,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Lance  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll